<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns A+ to Ajinomoto Captial Euro MTN.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns A+ to Ajinomoto Captial Euro MTN.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) assigned a A+ rating on Friday to a $300 million Euro medium-term note programme offered by Ajinomoto Capital (Europe) BV, which benefits from a keepwell agreement with Ajinomoto Co Inc.</p>
<p>S&amp;P also affirmed its A-1 short-term rating for Ajinomoto Co Inc and its guaranteed subsidiary Ajinomoto USA Inc.</p>
<p>The outlook for the rating was positive, S&amp;P said.</p>
</text>
